{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在進一步加強Windows 11的系統安全策略。根據近期用户和媒體觀察，越來越多安裝最新版本Windows 11的設備開始自動啓用「內存完整性（Memory Integrity）」功能。這項被微軟視為重要安全防線的技術能夠提升系統抵禦惡意軟件和驅動程序攻擊的能力，但與此同時，也再度引發部分遊戲玩家對於性能損失的擔憂。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585888.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.551783+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:29:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.460180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.460180+00:00","content_hash":"37720198f7f7f2ef77c9711974fbfde6d026232beed46a6aa3254b3a9ad0e169","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}